  <body dur="03:02.160">
    <div begin="00:39.310" end="03:02.160">
      <p begin="00:39.310" end="00:46.410" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:39.310" end="00:39.420">C</span><span begin="00:39.420" end="00:40.150">lear</span> <span begin="00:40.260" end="00:40.690">mor</span><span begin="00:40.850" end="00:41.420">ning</span> <span begin="00:41.420" end="00:42.270">light,</span> <span begin="00:42.550" end="00:42.770">your</span> <span begin="00:42.860" end="00:43.550">voi</span><span begin="00:43.550" end="00:43.650">ce</span> <span begin="00:43.650" end="00:43.880">so</span> <span begin="00:43.880" end="00:44.070">s</span><span begin="00:44.070" end="00:46.370">wee</span><span begin="00:46.370" end="00:46.410">t</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">澄澈的晨光中 你的声音如此温柔</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">澄澈的晨光中 你的聲音如此溫柔</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">澄みわたる朝の光 君の声はどこまでも優しく</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">맑은 아침 햇살 너의 목소리는 너무나 달콤해</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Claire lumière du matin ta voix si douce</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Clara luz de la mañana tu voz tan dulce</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Klares Morgenlicht deine Stimme so sanft</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Clara luz da manhã sua voz tão doce</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Ясный утренний свет твой голос так нежен</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Chiara luce del mattino la tua voce così dolce</span></p>
      <p begin="00:47.830" end="00:55.100" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:47.830" end="00:48.200">Lo</span><span begin="00:48.200" end="00:48.350">s</span><span begin="00:48.350" end="00:48.430">t</span> <span begin="00:48.430" end="00:48.550">in</span> <span begin="00:48.550" end="00:48.640">a</span> <span begin="00:48.710" end="00:49.820">dream,</span> <span begin="00:50.120" end="00:50.470">foun</span><span begin="00:50.470" end="00:50.630">d a</span><span begin="00:50.720" end="00:52.100">gain</span> <span begin="00:52.200" end="00:52.770">in</span> <span begin="00:52.770" end="00:53.060">you</span><span begin="00:53.060" end="00:54.990">r eye</span><span begin="00:54.990" end="00:55.100">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">曾迷失于梦境 又在你的眼中寻回自己</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">曾迷失於夢境 又在你的眼中尋回自己</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">夢の中で迷い 君の瞳の中でまた自分を見つけた</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">꿈속에서 길을 잃고 너의 눈동자 속에서 다시 나를 찾았어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Perdu dans un rêve je me retrouve dans tes yeux</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Me perdí en un sueño volví a encontrarme en tus ojos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">In einem Traum verloren in deinen Augen wiedergefunden</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Perdido num sonho me reencontro em seus olhos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Потерян во сне и вновь найден в твоих глазах</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perso in un sogno ritrovato nei tuoi occhi</span></p>
      <p begin="00:56.570" end="00:59.910" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:56.570" end="00:56.730">I'd</span> <span begin="00:56.840" end="00:57.030">gi</span><span begin="00:57.030" end="00:57.120">ve</span> <span begin="00:57.120" end="00:57.590">you</span> <span begin="00:57.590" end="00:57.870">my</span> <span begin="00:57.980" end="00:59.880">sigh</span><span begin="00:59.880" end="00:59.910">t</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愿将我的视界赠予你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我願將我的視界贈予你</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">この目さえ君に捧げよう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내 시야를 너에게 줄게</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je te donnerais ma vue</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Te daría mi vista</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich würde dir mein Augenlicht schenken</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu daria a você minha visão</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я отдам тебе своё зрение</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ti donerei la mia vista</span></p>
      <p begin="01:01.170" end="01:05.580" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="01:01.170" end="01:01.400">For</span><span begin="01:01.500" end="01:02.240">ge</span><span begin="01:02.350" end="01:02.870">t all</span> <span begin="01:02.870" end="01:03.110">I've</span> <span begin="01:03.210" end="01:05.580">seen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">忘却我曾目睹的一切</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">忘卻我曾目睹的一切</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">この目で見てきたすべてを忘れて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내가 보아 온 모든 것을 잊고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">J’oublierais tout ce que j’ai vu</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Olvida todo lo que he visto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">All das vergessen was ich je gesehen habe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Esqueceria tudo o que já vi</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Забудь всё что я видел</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dimenticherei tutto ciò che ho visto</span></p>
      <p begin="01:06.470" end="01:16.000" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="01:06.470" end="01:06.750">I</span> <span begin="01:06.860" end="01:07.100">could</span> <span begin="01:07.290" end="01:08.980">see,</span> <span begin="01:09.400" end="01:09.690">but</span> <span begin="01:09.690" end="01:10.400">no</span><span begin="01:10.500" end="01:11.430">t a</span><span begin="01:11.430" end="01:11.720">ny</span><span begin="01:11.720" end="01:16.000">more</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我曾经还能看见 如今却再也不能</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我曾經還能看見 如今卻再也不能</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">かつては見えていた でも今はもう見えない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">볼 수 있었지만 이제는 볼 수 없어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je pouvais voir mais plus maintenant</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Podía ver pero ya no</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich konnte sehen doch jetzt nicht mehr</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eu podia enxergar mas não mais</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Когда-то я мог видеть но теперь уже нет</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Potevo vedere ma ora non più</span></p>
